        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, if we manufacture all of our commercial supplies of bulk drug product with a manufacturer other than WuXi Biologics or its affiliates, we are required to make royalty payments to WuXi Biologics in an amount equal to a fraction of a single digit percentage of global net sales of WuXi Biologics Licensed Products manufactured by a third-party manufacturer (the “Royalty”).",
        "start_character": 44492,
        "end_character": 44877
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given the company’s stage of development, we currently do not have a commercial organization for the marketing, sales and distribution of pharmaceutical products.",
        "start_character": 30876,
        "end_character": 31038
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we manufacture part of our commercial supplies of the WuXi Biologics Licensed Products with WuXi Biologics or its affiliates, then the Royalty will be reduced accordingly on a pro rata basis.",
        "start_character": 44878,
        "end_character": 45072
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we are subject to a variety of regulations in other jurisdictions governing, among other things, research and development, clinical trials, testing, manufacturing, safety, efficacy, quality control, labeling, packaging, storage, record keeping, distribution, reporting, export and import, advertising, marketing and other promotional practices involving biological products as well as authorization, approval as well as post-approval monitoring and reporting of our products.",
        "start_character": 117000,
        "end_character": 117524
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In light of the recently enacted BIOSECURE Act, which prohibits federal agencies from entering into procurement contracts with an entity that uses biotechnology equipment or services from a biotechnology company of concern, we are strengthening our supply chain in the event that WuXi Biologics or one of our other manufacturers is impacted by the BIOSECURE Act or any similar legislation.",
        "start_character": 32246,
        "end_character": 32635
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "It is also possible that the development of a cure or more effective treatment method for any of our targeted indications by a competitor could render our product candidates non-competitive or obsolete, or reduce the demand for our product candidates before we can recover our development and commercialization expenses.",
        "start_character": 36783,
        "end_character": 37103
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of our existing or potential competitors have substantially greater financial, technical and human resources than we do and significantly greater experience in the discovery and development of product candidates, as well as in obtaining regulatory approvals of those product candidates in the United States and in foreign countries.",
        "start_character": 35979,
        "end_character": 36316
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business could be adversely affected if we are unable to use third-party manufacturing suites or if the third-party manufacturers encounter difficulties in production.”",
        "start_character": 33143,
        "end_character": 33315
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Outside of Greater China, we currently hold worldwide development and commercialization rights, including through exclusive licenses, to all of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 31494,
        "end_character": 31661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See the risk factor entitled “We currently rely and expect to rely in the future on the use of manufacturing suites in third-party facilities or on third parties to manufacture claseprubart, DNTH212 and any other product candidates, and we may rely on third parties to produce and process our products, if approved.",
        "start_character": 32827,
        "end_character": 33142
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Should any of our product candidates be approved for commercialization, we intend to develop a plan to commercialize them in the United States and other key markets, through internal infrastructure and/or external partnerships in a manner that will enable us to realize the full commercial value of our programs.",
        "start_character": 30563,
        "end_character": 30875
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001690585-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001690585-26-000006-56daf2ae45cbe086",
        "accession_number": "0001690585-26-000006",
